  m_text: "Each player has their own resources to manage. Enemies will try to deplete
    a certain resource so that a right strategy can be made to prevent that or try
    to be the one to overrun your enemy.\r\n\r\nCorporation - Each card from this
    player will harm certain resources. \r\n\nEnvironmentalist - Main resources will
    be wood, water. While there are more resources for you to manage, try to defend
    your resources as much as possible. \r\n\nBot will in role of the Corporation
    and Player will be Environmentalist. If your card does not have a certain resources
    to defend the bot, you will lose life.\r\n\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaee9cf059da0ce4d9e8f209d475257b, type: 2}
